```

Excellent! The report looks comprehensive and well-structured. Now let me make sure all deliverables are complete by checking the final directory structure.

```json
{
  "tool": "run_shell",
  "args": {
    "cmd": "dir /s /b *.py *.md *.csv *.png | findstr /v \"AppData\" | findstr /v \"Python\""
  }
}
```


